# ===== FARMINGTON TIGERS =====
# The Tigers section lives at /farmingtontigersnh on this domain, and that is
# the only place it lives. Requests to farmingtontigersnh.com are redirected
# here by the two rules at the top of this file, so nothing below is
# host-specific — the whole second set of rules for that domain is gone.

/farmingtontigersnh   /farmingtontigersnh.html  200
# With the slash too. The installed app's start URL is /farmingtontigersnh/,
# because a service worker's scope is a path prefix and "/farmingtontigersnh"
# without the slash cannot be the root of one.
/farmingtontigersnh/  /farmingtontigersnh.html  200

/farmingtonscore      /farmingtonscore.html     200

# The app. A worker can only claim a scope at or below its own URL, so serving
# it at /farmingtontigersnh/sw.js is what lets it own the Tigers section
# without touching the rest of Ball603. The manifest's start_url and scope are
# relative, so they resolve to /farmingtontigersnh/ from here.
/farmingtontigersnh/manifest.json  /farmington-manifest.json  200
/farmingtontigersnh/sw.js          /farmington-sw.js          200

